/Div { dup 0 eq { pop } { div } ifelse } def  	% control the division
/NET { neg exch neg exch T } def	      	% change coordinate system to the negative one		
/Pyth { dup mul exch dup mul add sqrt } def   	% Pythagoras, epects 2 parameter
